    "created_at": "2016-07-18T17:33:55Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-18T17:33:55Z",
    "body": "We could have a note that we don't care about Unicode normalization in general for general-purpose platform APIs, this algorithm doesn't either, that folks should normalize to NFC before distribution generally, and that people thinking of using this algorithm should probably use case-sensitive comparison for their API instead...\n",
