    "body": "I don't really feel comfortable saying that we don't care about Unicode normalization. Maybe @littledan has more background from his work with the Ecma 402 folks, but I am pretty sure there are at least parts of the standards and implementer community for which that is not true. The Bugzilla bug you linked to shows several people very involved in trying to account for such things, and presumably @littledan filing this issue is a reflection of the same concern.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
