    "created_at": "2016-07-18T17:45:38Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-18T17:45:38Z",
    "body": "I'm pretty sure we don't ever want Unicode normalization for the algorithms we're talking about here. It makes sense to expose those algorithms to developers so they can use them on text. It doesn't make sense to use them in APIs that use strings as identifiers.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
